            },
            {
              "key": "3ohf0",
              "text": "Interior lighting has had a broad fog and polish pass across the maintenance, generic, command and habitation buildings, with lights added above medical cabinets and shadow distances reduced on casters. Compound lighting has been reworked to stop light leaking through walls, and the turret tiles have had their red and orange lighting rebalanced. Agriculture rings have had spill lighting added.",
              "type": "unstyled",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "cl8qk",
              "text": "Safes have been moved out of kitchens and into storage rooms",
              "type": "unordered-list-item",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "4thu3",
              "text": "Backs added to exposed ladders, so they no longer read as unfinished",
              "type": "unordered-list-item",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "81vmb",
              "text": "Maintenance room doors have been correctly centered on their frames",
              "type": "unordered-list-item",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "6gnmf",
              "text": "Potential Fix: Stacked decals on storage roofs, misaligned roof effects, floating props and a hole in the generic outpost exteriors",
              "type": "unordered-list-item",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "4d23p",
              "text": "Potential Fix: A misaligned vent module in the compound wall, with tint and rib placement improved across compound walls",
              "type": "unordered-list-item",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "7maga",
              "text": "Potential Fix: Unnecessary climbing points removed from habitation and depot tiles",
