            {
              "key": "587ge",
              "text": "Virtual Reality",
              "type": "unstyled",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [
                {
                  "offset": 0,
                  "length": 15,
                  "style": "UNDERLINE"
                },
                {
                  "offset": 0,
                  "length": 15,
                  "style": "BOLD"
                }
              ],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "8c1hl",
              "text": "These updates are very experimental so please let us know if you find any oddities with these updated VR changes!",
              "type": "unstyled",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "3ib6j",
              "text": "",
              "type": "unstyled",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "7suln",
              "text": "The weapon customization interface has been rebuilt as a 3D object for VR. Attachment ports are now drawn directly on the weapon rather than in a flat panel, selected with the stereo cursor, with the attachment list scrolled using the mouse wheel. Your character also stops leaning to follow your head while the interface is open, which previously shifted the view.",
              "type": "unstyled",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "87q5e",
              "text": "",
              "type": "unstyled",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "632ds",
              "text": "The stereo cursor now switches between eye tracking and manual aiming automatically, handing control to the mouse when you move it and returning to eye tracking after a couple of seconds",
              "type": "unstyled",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
            {
              "key": "2mn95",
              "text": "The radial menus now use the stereo cursor directly, and work from head direction when eye tracking is unavailable.",
              "type": "unstyled",
              "depth": 0,
              "inlineStyleRanges": [],
              "entityRanges": [],
              "data": []
            },
